  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mongolia Green Finance Corporation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme is a joint public and private sector effort to create a national financing vehicle, Mongolia Green Finance Corporation (MGFC), to overcome challenges and constraints for climate change mitigation in Mongolia.

&#x2022; MGFC is a first-of-its-kind public-private partnership (PPP)-based green bank involving the entire banking sector, with strong potential for replication in developing country contexts.
&#x2022; MGFC will develop the capacity for climate finance of the entire Mongolian financial sector, which does not exist in the market and could probably not be developed by existing institutions.
&#x2022; It promotes country ownership, and targets high impact sectors in line with national priorities</narrative>
  </description>
